  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science Granting Council System Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will be delivered through the pan-African Science Granting Councils Initiative (SGCI) &#x2013; delivered in partnership with IDRC (Canada), SIDA (Sweden), NORAD (Norway) and Wellcome. The research is delivered through the Science Granting Councils (SGCs) in 18 countries across Africa responding directly to local needs, positioning the Councils as regional and global leaders in S&amp;T systems.</narrative>
  </description>
